<title>FINLAND: ATRIA SEES H2 RESULT UP ON H1.</title>
<headline>ATRIA SEES H2 RESULT UP ON H1.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish foodstuffs group Atria Oy said in a statement on Monday it expects its result to improve in the second half of 1996 compared to the first half.</p>
<p>&quot;The result of the second year-half is expected to improve on the early part of the year,&quot; Atria said.</p>
<p>Atria said earlier its January-June profit before extraordinary items, appropriations and taxes fell to 15 million markka from 39 in the first-half of 1995.</p>
</text>
